{"id":"660577","name":"菌菇焖饭","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/660577/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"松茸","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡枞菌","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"瘦肉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"大米","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"入手了一些松茸和鸡枞菌。","img":"images/660577/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"将菌菇洗净切片。","img":"images/660577/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"胡萝卜洗净去皮切小粒。","img":"images/660577/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"瘦肉洗净切片。","img":"images/660577/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"瘦肉加入适量蚝油，生抽，花生油抓匀腌制入味。","img":"images/660577/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"大米先淘洗干净。","img":"images/660577/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入比平时煮饭的水量要少一点。","img":"images/660577/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"锅中热油放入瘦肉炒匀。","img":"images/660577/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入胡萝卜翻炒。","img":"images/660577/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"少许蚝油，盐调味。","img":"images/660577/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入菌菇。","img":"images/660577/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"翻炒均匀炒软即可。","img":"images/660577/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"将炒过的菌菇转入锅中。","img":"images/660577/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"电饭煲煮饭模式即可。","img":"images/660577/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"焖好的饭将它翻拌均匀即可。","img":"images/660577/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/660577/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/660577/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品（松茸简单用黄油煎过）。","img":"images/660577/step_18.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饭煲、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}